    "id": "c009",
    "name": "Separate-Nucleus Acknowledgment for Excess Funds Claims",
    "text": "Lincoln General agrees that the Excess Funds Claim(s) do not adse out of the same nucleus of operative facts as any claims or counterclaims asserted in the Lawsuit, and thus may appropriately be brought in a separate lawsuit."
  },
  {
    "id": "c010",
    "name": "Preclusion Waiver for Excess Funds Claims",
    "text": "Further, Lincoln General expressly relinquishes and waives its dght to assert that the Excess Funds Claim(s) are barred by the doctrines of ms judicata or collateral estoppel as a result of any findings of fact, conclusions of law, judgments, verdicts, arbitration decisions, o.r other determinations made as part of the Lawsuit."
  },
  {
    "id": "c011",
    "name": "Tolling for Excess Funds Claims",
    "text": "Lincoln General also agrees to toll the running of the statute of limitations for the the Excess Funds Claim(s) until the Lawsuit has been settled or otherwise finally resolved, including the completion of any appeals."
  },
  {
    "id": "c012",
    "name": "Existing Limitations Defenses for Excess Funds Claims",
    "text": "By agreeing to toll the running of the statute of limitations in this fashion, Lincoln General is not waiving its right or ability to assert any limitations defenses which may exist immediately before this agreement is executed."
  },
  {
    "id": "c013",
    "name": "Filing Stay for Excess Funds Claims",
    "text": "Finally, any separate lawsuit involving the Excess Funds Claim(s) may not be filed by U.S. Auto dudng the penden.cy of the Lawsuit."
  },
  {
    "id": "c014",
    "name": "Separate-Nucleus Acknowledgment for Other Causes of Action",
    "text": "In excl~ange, Defendants agree that the Other Causes of Action do not arise out of the same nucleus of operative facts as any claims or c~untercla!ms asserted in the Lawsuit and thus may appropriately be brought in a separate lawsuit."
  },
  {
